<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"I knew it. I am fated never to leave Shigatsu Youka. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-san</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Itohime<STYLE ID="2"> turned a smile toward me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But tears spilled from her eyes once more.</STYLE><PG>
"I was glad, at the end, to have known <STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE> kindness."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, hurry...!"</STYLE><PG>
"That you showed mercy to one as sinful as I―I cannot express my gratitude. 
{PAUSE ""}
To be able to meet my end with this feeling in my heart... 
{PAUSE ""}
If only I had met <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> sooner..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE><PG>
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2,人物3" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
"Goodbye."<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜吹雪風船なし.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n798\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n798\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">At that moment, a wind like a typhoon tore through this deep place where no wind should reach, and that sound rang out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The piled cherry petals whirled up like a blizzard and stole our sight.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Wh-what the hell is this...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I groped around for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Luckily, I managed to take both their hands right away.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜のじゅうたん.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "SE" "500" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n798\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n500\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{PLAYMOVIE "桜山頂.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "600" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n10000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">But the moment I took their hands, the gale died as if it had never been, and the soft rustle of falling cherry blossoms filled the air.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"What happened...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! You there!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I'm here! So are </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Nobody's been injected, have they!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I think we're all right!"</STYLE><PG>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<STYLE ID="2">Before long, most of the blossoms had fallen to the ground, and the silence and the scenery returned as they had been.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Except for one thing.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Where's </STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">She's not here..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\ドローガ落とした.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Itohime<STYLE ID="2">―where she had been standing, a single syringe.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Inside the brand-new syringe, which showed no sign of use, was a pink liquid.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\心臓の鼓動一発.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\ドローガ落とした2.gal" "NORMAL" "25" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I won't forgive you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"As if I'd ever forgive you...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Words of resentment, coming from somewhere.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But none of us had opened our mouths.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">They were coming from somewhere above.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Cage.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜縦長.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ木.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎木.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "-540" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">―!!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Sunk into the cherry trees: </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The two of them were writhing like cursed dolls, muttering words of resentment.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="8">...! Have you forgotten what you owe me...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"I've drained all the nourishment from this land. So I can't live here anymore."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="8">, </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="8">'re coming too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Together let us put down roots in the land of Motoki and achieve </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="えいごう">eternal</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> flourishing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="8">, I haven't </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> you at all. Come now, let's go together."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> they may be, but their voices and their tone are nothing like before.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">These are </STYLE>Shigatsu Youka<STYLE ID="2">'s words―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">it's only using </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Ojisan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> tongues and vocal cords.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">―That's right! Don't let </STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="2"> escape!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―Called a goddess, and it went to your head!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―No escape.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―</STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="2">, betrayal will not be forgiven.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―</STYLE>You<STYLE ID="2"> will stay my eternal slave!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Voices like that came from all around.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Voices that seemed to echo from inside the trees reached my ears.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\桜のじゅうたん.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "30"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\地響き.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"N-not another earthquake...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Ahahahaha! It's coming! It's coming!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"The Goddess makes her entrance!!!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\爆発.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山頂\地割れ.gal" "NORMAL" "12" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{QUAKESTOP "3000"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック2.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Right in front of us, that eerie sound rang out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The sound was coming from inside the cracks in the ground.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"It's coming... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">it's coming!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Wh-what's coming...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Shigatsu Youka<STYLE ID="1">'s... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">main body."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\爆発.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\エデン\巨大サクラ生える2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "540" "100" "12" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n-5000\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n-5000\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\000.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "10000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\死月妖花遠景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "111" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\死月妖花.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Taken into a giant cherry tree, </STYLE>Itohime<STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This is―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Shigatsu Youka<STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
